    LLM: 'Players place one legal matching tile to an open end of the shared layout. When blocked, the table profile determines whether to draw from a boneyard or pass. Hands end when a player empties their hand or when the table becomes blocked, and scoring follows the table profile.',
    Player: 'Players place one legal matching tile to an open end of the shared layout. When blocked, the table profile determines whether to draw from a boneyard or pass. Hands end when a player empties their hand or when the table becomes blocked, and scoring follows the table profile.',
